br /> <b>p. 36:</b> <i>Seattle 1999's immanent evolution</i> While &quot;immanent&quot; is also a word, it doesn't mean &quot;impending.&quot; Imminent.<br /> <b>p. 37:</b> <i>Thile many things about the Seattle 1999 shard</i> Typo. While.<br /> <b>p. 37:</b> <i>The park is a maze of secretive walkways and islands, a freeway underpass frequented by graffiti artists, hidden nooks and crannies where teenagers go to experiment with alcohol and gay men and the occasional lesbian cruise for anonymous sex.</i> This is a heck of a run-on sentence; try and diagram it. The final clause is also confusing without the Oxford comma to clarify where the beer thought ends and the pickup thought begins.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-27T20:18:22-07:00","id":242811,"title":"","content":"p. 76 <i>At present, the collection includes \u2014 among others \u2014 three stone tablets covered with incomprehensible writing, a leather-bound journal full of grotesque sketches and Hebrew notations written in a hurried and only vaguely legible hand,<b> a </b>five dusty human skulls, and an otherwise unremarkable piece of leather with one hundred and sixty-nine holes poked in it, seemingly at random. </i>The 'a' shouldn't be there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/463-derendel","name":"Derendel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar463_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"